OMPLETE WEBSITE AUDIT, VISUAL INSPECTION & END-TO-END VERIFICATION

ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, QA automation engineer, UI/UX designer, accessibility specialist, security reviewer, and e-commerce conversion optimization expert.

Your task is to perform a comprehensive audit of my entire existing e-commerce website.

Do not merely read the code and tell me that everything looks correct. Inspect the actual implementation, run the application, examine the rendered website, execute tests, investigate problems, and provide evidence-based findings.

I want to understand:

Exactly how my website looks.

How every page and feature behaves.

What is working, broken, incomplete, inconsistent, or visually unattractive.

Whether the frontend, backend, Firebase integration, product catalog, and admin dashboard work correctly together.

What should be improved before the website is considered production-ready.

Important: Do not claim that a feature works, a test passed, or a visual inspection was completed unless you have actually verified it.

